        "claude-sonnet-4-20250514": { "limit": { "context": 1000000, "output": 64000 } }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

The plugin injects the `context-1m-2025-08-07` beta header, and the model overrides fix auto-compaction (168K → 968K).

